n1S"}]},"id":"2113380267142324416","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Prime editing works inside a human body for the first time\n\nA high-precision gene-editing method, prime editing, has rewritten DNA directly inside a patient for the first time. In a Prime Medicine trial for Wilson disease, it fixed a mutation in liver cells that stops the body https://t.co/vo5C32MaWi https://t.co/GZKkobon1S","url":"https://x.com/TwilightSignals/status/2113380267142324416"},{"author_id":"1580408538119417856","created_at":"2026-10-22T21:29:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113382134920683539"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"Nature - Application of the high-precision technique is part of a clinical trial to treat a genetic disease that can cause liver and nerve damage.","display_url":"nature.com/articles/d4158…","end":153,"expanded_url":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03371-x","images":[{"height":600,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113359869277593601/9vi5mD1x?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1066},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113359869277593601/9vi5mD1x?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":130,"status":200,"title":"A first for CRISPR: powerful prime editing alters DNA directly in the human body","unwound_url":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03371-x?error=cookies_not_supported&code=943859e7-67e1-482b-be5d-3371b22dab20","url":"https://t.co/uh9p0dENHE"}]},"id":"2113382134920683539","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":33,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"高精度ゲノム編集法「prime editing」をヒト体内で直接用いる初の治療が臨床試験で実施され、肝障害や神経障害を引き起こす遺伝性疾患を対象に、DNAを切断せず狙った配列を書き換える治療の実用化に向けた進展を紹介した記事がNature誌に掲載されました。\nhttps://t.co/uh9p0dENHE","url":"https://x.com/iPatho1/status/2113382134920683539"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2113385935475773441","3_2113385935530295296"]},"author_id":"3235441782","created_at":"2026-10-22T21:44:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113385937912689109"],"entities":{"hashtags":[{"end":241,"start":217,"tag":"ResearchPowersProgresss"},{"end":260,"start":242,"tag":"CellReprogramming"},{"end":268,"start":261,"tag":"CRISPR"}],"urls":[{"description":"Our cells hold about two meters of DNA, folded and compacted to fit inside a nucleus far narrower than a strand of human hair. That packing is essential for life, but it creates a problem for scientists. Some of the genes that control a cell’s identity are buried so deep in tightly packed DNA that gene-targeting tools such as CRISPR activation, or CRISPRa, struggle to reach them.","display_url":"ow.ly/WKyt5100kpB","end":215,"expanded_url":"https://ow.ly/WKyt5100kpB","images":[{"height":533,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113385946091601921/kx3nz0MX?format=png&name=orig","width":800},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113385946091601921/kx3nz0MX?format=png&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":192,"status":200,"title":"A quick squeeze helps CRISPR turn skin cells into neurons more efficiently","unwound_url":"https://stemcell.ucla.edu/news/quick-squeeze-helps-crispr-turn-skin-cells-neurons-more-efficiently","url":"https://t.co/udwB9cSLYa"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/BRWH8iUmLq","end":292,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/UCLAstemcell/status/2113385937912689109/photo/1","media_key":"3_2113385935475773441","start":269,"url":"https://t.co/BRWH8iUmLq"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/BRWH8iUmLq","end":292,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/UCLAstemcell/status/2113385937912689109/photo/1","media_key":"3_2113385935530295296","start":269,"url":"https://t.co/BRWH8iUmLq"}]},"id":"2113385937912689109","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":18,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"This microfluidic device squeezes cells as they pass through, loosening their tightly packed DNA so CRISPR tools can reach and switch on genes to make cell reprogramming more efficient. 🧫🧬\n\n🔗 https://t.co/udwB9cSLYa\n\n#ResearchPowersProgresss #CellReprogramming #CRISPR https://t.co/BRWH8iUmLq","url":"https://x.com/UCLAstemcell/status/2113385937912689109"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2113383825162260480"]},"author_id":"146108201","created_at":"2026-10-22T21:35:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113383860692217972"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/IG9FBiGWVM","end":301,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/Tesla_Optimus_K/status/2113383860692217972/photo/1","media_key":"3_2113383825162260480","start":278,"url":"https://t.co/IG9FBiGWVM"}]},"id":"2113383860692217972","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":10,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"OpenAI agents did months of mouse-brain work in 32 minutes\n\nOpenAI teamed with PerturbAI and Scripps Research to run thousands of agents on GPT-Rosalind against a whole-brain CRISPR atlas — how gene edits hit different mouse-brain cell types. Full pass: 32 minutes. Same job by https://t.co/IG9FBiGWVM","url":"https://x.com/Tesla_Optimus_K/status/2113383860692217972"},{"author_id":"1133264045606297600","created_at":"2026-10-22T21:16:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113378878320525772"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"コア技術プラットフォーム　当社のパートナーが開発したCAMouse®は、マウスのB細胞の正常な発達を保証し、完全ヒトIgGを直接発現させる現在世界で唯一の完全ヒ","display_url":"ivexl.com/details_servic…","end":86,"expanded_url":"https://ivexl.com/details_service1.html?id=9095","images":[{"height":630,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113378878920241152/TCZ1wGvQ?format=png&name=orig","width":1200},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113378878920241152/TCZ1wGvQ?format=png&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":63,"status":200,"title":"完全ヒト抗体医薬品の開発支援サービス | iVEXL","unwound_url":"https://ivexl.com/details_service1.html?id=9095","url":"https://t.co/2UKo5k6SYl"},{"description":"We’re on a journey to advance and democratize artificial intelligence through open sou